/Keywords (*ARMY OPERATIONS;MAINTENANCE;MILITARY INTELLIGENCE;COMBAT SURVEILLANCE;MINE CLEARANCE;LOGISTICS;MILITARY TRAINING;PSYCHOLOGICAL WARFARE;LAND MINES;ARTILLERY;DOGS)
/Subject (During the reporting period the 1st Cav Div AM continued operations throughout the TAOI to interdict enemy infiltration routes through Tay Ninh, Phuoc Long, Binh Long and Binh Duong Provinces in order to deny enemy access to the population center, and to neutralize enemy forces operating throughout the area. Division elements continued to support the GVN Pacification Program and conducted Dong Tien operations with RVNAF forces operating within the Division TAOI.)
/Title (Lessons Learned, Headquarters, 1st Cavalry Division)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/AD0509704.pdf)
>>
